{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "785ea7583e2de1d81be9a13d9c627e40a6e1b4b3a6bfe51932f5a1d5c7759f83", "ja": "姉と妹", "zh": "姐姐与妹妹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c3646687eee9a50ba102ce97f98b76112c3f9bd70dde59b2e04140b3e44d2bd6", "ja": "織姫は笹森藍と共に『I.V.』というデュオ\nアイドルとしてデビュー。瞬く間にスターの\n座を駆け上がり、セキュリティのため引っ越\nすなど、姉妹の生活は一変する。全ては順風\n満帆であるかのように思われたが…。", "zh": "织姬与笹森蓝组成名为《I.V.》的双人偶像组合出道。姐妹俩转眼间便登上了明星的宝座，甚至为了安全搬了家，生活就此发生了翻天覆地的变化。一切似乎都在顺利发展，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1000_049mom", "source_sha256": "ed2596346cb73d865283297219c5322ebf93214eb1e390dbe71dcd3a71293872", "ja": "アイドルになった織姫は、\nまずデュオとしてデビュー。", "zh": "成为偶像的织姬，首先以双人组合的形式出道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "19a984cd88059af589cdfb34f537a014f733c84b41841106ed85d6f11efb4139", "ja": "その秘められた才能を発揮。\n瞬く間に、スターの座を駆け上がっていった。", "zh": "展现出那隐藏的才能。  \n转眼间便一路攀上了明星的宝座。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "8c7d112ca8f4bc2ceae4d2034838b704ecbf310e5599707a80542345aa1e4017", "ja": "それはもう、誰もが驚くほどの早さだった。", "zh": "那速度快得让所有人都大吃一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "f2b96b0caea9e5341a40a625985464d19c2c604f759eaca5a8455fdb32c7ea57", "ja": "ちょっと、織姫？　アンタ遅れてきたんだから、\nさっさと準備しなさいよ！　今日は生放送なんだから！", "zh": "喂，织姬？你可是迟到了，赶紧准备好！今天可是现场直播！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "8855f8eee59552ea7c4724bb5ac32c318f30e7e4fe33760462b0b01fc1d86e51", "ja": "他のみんなはもうとっくにリハ終わって、\nスタッフさん達、アンタ待ちなんだから。", "zh": "其他人早就结束彩排了，工作人员们都在等你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "13e7077d17eab9ec861447771a8f2eee77fa64d640703d7e5cdb67d66cf68190", "ja": "うん！　ごめんね、藍（らん）ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯！对不起，蓝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "845f3f758628c47129943c9c55341557ad1bfec67650a8e4742e5d389d9ffbca", "ja": "織姫、ちょっといいかしら。", "zh": "织姬，能占用你一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "b25e8e1f43cd8ea9adde1b3e868725c64c182f23b7854667ffa443e3c5d6f0f0", "ja": "はいっ、神宮寺さん！", "zh": "好的，神宫寺小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a72f442322531a8a89c046794ab9f2917e494d6f12e2616fee4075d82123ba31", "ja": "引っ越しの件、ちょうどいい部屋が見つかったから。\n早速、今晩からそこに行ってもらう。", "zh": "搬家那件事，我已经找到了合适的房间。\n今晚起你们就立刻搬去那里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bec07fcca44ae13238903f3c165e4800e6778411b5231f68fbe2a39cc9d3f258", "ja": "とりあえず貴方達は、必要なものだけ持っていって。\n後は業者に任せて運んでもらう。それでいい？", "zh": "总之，你们先把必要的东西带走。\n剩下的交给搬家公司搬过去。这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "1daf6bba7777b492c0cf86bf049e4f298e475f07f1254df85e40db911438bc7d", "ja": "はいっ！\n神宮寺さん、何から何までありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的！\n神宫寺小姐，真的非常感谢您为我们做的一切！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1011_idol1", "source_sha256": "ee9401e5c0fc210127ac5403fd7442d47308ecd5a676b2672804eefdf8cba402", "ja": "……なんか織姫ちゃんって、マネージャーさんに\nすっごい贔屓されてるよね……。", "zh": "……感觉织姬好像特别受经纪人偏爱呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1012_idol2", "source_sha256": "50c59040f81804cfc8e4b07fc213d78764877485fc8f4f0f05e3c38b07c35abf", "ja": "わかる、なんか特別って感じだもんね。", "zh": "我懂，总觉得有种特别的感觉嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1014_null", "source_sha256": "b4defce4b27de231f6ffb3c4345b74b5d26a832e60b8e52c9a71538b6ddb1871", "ja": "生放送終了後……", "zh": "直播结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "9dc6ef30ac67588330d888fdb92daf9c20ee18cfd0318b01b9dd3f82497120ce", "ja": "ほんっっと、何考えてるのよ、アンタ！！！", "zh": "真是的，你到底在想什么啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "eefe987cb6bf1e13b696ed563725f10c667435c026c8c1a64f062a7309fcee58", "ja": "ごめんなさい～！！！", "zh": "对不起～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "e86dd120a776ec834cb35d0965dd7e1e238decb64645d84b786fefb3af32ea7a", "ja": "ステージに出ていくなり、躓いて転ぶとか……\nそんなアイドル、一体どこにいるっていうのよ！", "zh": "才一上台就绊了一跤摔倒什么的……\n哪有这样的偶像啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "b7b7f89b93804d3ad987766fdb2bfd890e8de5186df941a886931036fddc59d8", "ja": "こ、ここにいま～す……えへへ……。\nまさか、段差があるとは思わなくって……。", "zh": "我、我就在这里～……嘿嘿……  \n没想到那里居然有台阶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "d9b490eced4f52219439f3e193518b694c881665fdd08a53451f6d387851ca1e", "ja": "本番であんなミス……はぁ、信じらんない。", "zh": "正式演出时居然犯那种错误……唉，真是不敢相信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "1cb2e9599618edd49921931e7d0e3a75b6e525218719692bdea86b842cdd3330", "ja": "アンタほんと、アイドル舐めてんの？\nこの世界、そんなに甘いもんじゃないんだからね！", "zh": "你这家伙，真把偶像当儿戏了吗？\n这个世界可没那么好混，知道吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "a5966dfb294ca107627513eeed3431ad1e2c97b8aa2e1a2bc8e35afc92f2e35d", "ja": "わかった！　次は、ちゃんと気を付けるから！", "zh": "知道了！下次我一定会好好注意的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "9c4fc9fc7d265a6175c7a1494954c7c4d858bb768fcc0d0c0553615e0c12040b", "ja": "……そうやって無邪気に『次』なんて\n言ってられるのだって、今のうちだけなのよ。", "zh": "……能像这样天真地说着“下次”，\n也就只有趁现在而已了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "84d459ac757c7a7f69dd680924acf5ef00c34586380a3723b924f1915f0512c3", "ja": "もういいわ、バカバカしい。\n……いつか絶対、アンタより上になってやる。", "zh": "算了，真是可笑。\n……总有一天，我绝对会超过你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "537abf54e3faec9b4246abd0e687204dfa809261e9742ed31fd9f46adb169504", "ja": "？　でも藍ちゃんの方が、\n歌もダンスも私より上手だよね？", "zh": "？不过蓝唱歌跳舞都比我厉害，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "56ffae3f2a187d254308e5c44f4a7275b1216bb1367a7510ed2bcc288b1dcce7", "ja": "ていうか、今日出演してた人たちの中でも、\n一番上手だったと思う！", "zh": "话说回来，在今天出演的人里，我觉得蓝酱也是最厉害的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "5983692317cfa1dacc38ae84dd8c51c5b3d6c5b1d6c9aae483fb323e43c6aa44", "ja": "！　バカ！　声が大きい！", "zh": "！笨蛋！声音太大了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "ef0253e3bcd742c9cad3bc9f593d74c8be2670c8e6ca5ba8acf2fa128b20a4fc", "ja": "あっ……ごめんなさい、えへへ。", "zh": "啊……对不起，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "64ac3a76621ee31b93d2c7dc0982b521f20f246e855c5c1ada78f386ceaa5612", "ja": "……とにかく、あんな低レベルなみっともないミス、\n二度としないで。わかった！？", "zh": "……总之，别再犯那种\n低级又丢人的失误了。听懂了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "4a64c01fc37d7f3f90d026d2b067844f38b1dd4e963ee050981bd8f12db3982d", "ja": "うん、わかった！　ごめんね！　がんばる！", "zh": "嗯，我知道了！对不起！我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "a756f597ae274cf476f0794876d5184c01599e0757ccb1f174f92cb933f1e8cf", "ja": "じゃーーーん！\nどうどうっ、真珠星！　すごくない！？", "zh": "锵——！\n怎么样，珍珠星！很厉害吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "8197c2add2be1e594c4cb6d9e0b8151ad8e6cb5ddc3dc3cde94734b856f34f06", "ja": "すごいけど……\nこれ、家賃払えるの？", "zh": "虽然很厉害……但这个能付房租吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "0aa559f84f5936f15150b3f41c78b187d28e68970d2eabe9d223449f05214904", "ja": "事務所が出してくれるんだって！　すごいよね～！\n今までのトコだと、セキュリティがなんとかって。", "zh": "听说事务所会替我们出钱！很厉害吧～！\n据说之前的地方，安保什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "75871db22517f3eaf0ae83e2155cb39b0d8d0e9527a2812a6de96d664fcb7375", "ja": "まあ、確かに最近はひどかったけど……。", "zh": "嗯，确实，最近是挺糟糕的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "8ac0762582546fafff42880c9d06f3f022978ee9a9c9c2bcc9da8c25abe01ace", "ja": "ご、ごめ～ん……。", "zh": "对、对不起嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "efe3893a36eb5b85f068357aeeca2bbcadc5c7dce5a00f431e7b9ee12599d283", "ja": "織姫お姉ちゃんが謝ることじゃないでしょ。\n悪いのは、押しかけてくるファンの人たちだし。", "zh": "这又不是织姬姐姐该道歉的事。错的是那些擅自找上门来的粉丝们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "0a9c0aa3452c10fdcbe30005f81bab3d526c247beabef7e24a81e18316a5d2f9", "ja": "それに、私の部屋ももらえたしね。\n落ち着いて勉強できそうで、うれしいな。", "zh": "而且，我还拿到了自己的房间呢。\n感觉可以静下心来学习了，真开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1040_029umi", "source_sha256": "fbcaf68e024c027feac4a4d67a50438ff36fb6209ea70dcac63c30277a91aa0e", "ja": "うんっ、そうなんだ！\nねえ、真珠星は今、何の勉強してるの？", "zh": "嗯，就是这样！\n对了，真珠星现在在学什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "6dba97d07c3d09f8ae810eb3fdbd467c78a9e82f9fdb8b7d37023c80c40fd5b0", "ja": "えっ？　えっと、これは理科だよ。\n生物かな。", "zh": "诶？那个，这是理科哦。\n算是生物吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "9c6deba054b40942aa8f515fcdb72075c7f61a2ab8a0c23a2d5351e7c328d89e", "ja": "ふーん、そっかぁ。\n……あはは、全然わかんないや！", "zh": "嗯——这样啊。\n……啊哈哈，我完全看不懂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "391a00e2b007fd02d377d7c4a28b2a593ea6130cb5cbded49c511947e6498f5d", "ja": "真珠星は賢いねえ。\nこんな難しい勉強ができて、えらいねえ。", "zh": "真珠星真聪明呀。能学会这么难的东西，真厉害呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "47c6fc36acbc8817a92c4f5c206f0ba05d05d0069d9b9548ab16f27acca9f691", "ja": "別に……そんなことないよ。それに、\nお姉ちゃんだって、いろんなことできるじゃん……。", "zh": "才不是……没那回事啦。而且，姐姐你不是也会做很多事嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1045_029umi", "source_sha256": "625a896799b233d21942c46818ccf848d89ac47d1be7db7e7c979debb931d468", "ja": "……ね、真珠星。お姉ちゃん、がんばって働くから。\nいっぱい勉強して、好きな学校に行きなね！", "zh": "……我说，真珠星。姐姐会努力工作的。\n你要好好用功读书，去考你想去的学校哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1047_029umi", "source_sha256": "f850beedb99181f27b11384366cd8441d120c23eaa9c9203fe278252c4964165", "ja": "私は、勉強得意じゃないからさー。\nその分、真珠星にがんばってもらおうっと。", "zh": "我不擅长学习嘛——。\n那就让真珠星多努力一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1048_049mom", "source_sha256": "8b0d17f7beb46e855842d4732113c17796d8dbb428e1c1b41460a4ef8253e935", "ja": "あ……あのね、お姉ちゃん。", "zh": "啊……那个，姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1049_029umi", "source_sha256": "690dac28f201e4c83eefc6ef2a0fc7a3e5bd2029370719dcf99f755a7304b081", "ja": "ん、なに？", "zh": "嗯，怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1050_049mom", "source_sha256": "2a081bd5037720b70d2ff93b4e6a2bfa534f13d53ff0c44a465e4c3b146d2065", "ja": "……私、お医者さんになりたいんだ。\nお医者さんになって、お母さんの病気治したい。", "zh": "……我想当医生。\n想成为医生，治好妈妈的病。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1051_029umi", "source_sha256": "0ae88e7105a48f76d706ba9c44bd6c85e0505213204031def61166bc464fcdf9", "ja": "えっ……そうなんだ！？　すごーい！", "zh": "诶……原来是这样！？好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1052_049mom", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1053_029umi", "source_sha256": "7be1d56557ca0211c32aa9deff58bfd2d6b645c0557467a6841392890ba9c519", "ja": "真珠星はほんと、私の自慢の妹だよ！", "zh": "真珠星真的是我引以为傲的妹妹啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1054_049mom", "source_sha256": "f4b6868a1862461a8dba65d68c77eb6f51964f7a675441b3476e0c9a3251b570", "ja": "うん……ありがと。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1055_029umi", "source_sha256": "f4799f297f4a57947a4943bc455e0437dc3fbfe96fed17c299e3cf64802b317d", "ja": "あ、お母さんで思い出した。\n私、明日ちょっと病院行ってくるね。", "zh": "啊，说到妈妈我想起来了。\n我明天去一趟医院。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1056_049mom", "source_sha256": "998d6325302bccb2d64532c57c8c5bd39aa3f09a90d8838c5ec3ec47f06c750d", "ja": "え？　だったら私も行くよ。", "zh": "诶？那样的话我也去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1057_029umi", "source_sha256": "4ce1addb36dae558148b5bcf5c70f9cad2fd323fc11955fbd2787b475d5f5b40", "ja": "真珠星は学校でしょ？　お仕事の書類に、ハンコを\nもらうだけだから。また今度、一緒にお見舞い行こ！", "zh": "真珠星不是还要上学吗？我只是去工作单位盖个章而已。下次再一起去探病吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1058_049mom", "source_sha256": "63366a6f416a31067425a48d1badf3e9cc28003554a7b3ee1518b46a2ed973c2", "ja": "……わかった。", "zh": "……我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1059_029umi", "source_sha256": "7dbc699261972e6765368901c21961e43b5c949a9e0510f4d4031a5092be41cf", "ja": "そうだ、今度マネージャーさんに会わせるね！\nびっくりすると思うよ！", "zh": "对了，下次介绍你和经纪人认识！\n你一定会大吃一惊的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1060_049mom", "source_sha256": "2c804684c3323cf2e79daee74bd6a12a2b6dfa8732e6b3658cfb1af0914cb47e", "ja": "びっくりって、何が？", "zh": "你说的惊讶，是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1061_029umi", "source_sha256": "e18300a477ada59c520b54d9427b6b47f7460f31d346b61107fcb3d8e2ad29a9", "ja": "えへへ、秘密！", "zh": "嘿嘿，秘密！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1063_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0ffa4099d01fb5889becc0dcc6cc5a3e5eab6d85a78b75a741499bad1f42d5b3", "ja": "……本当に、いいのね？\n始めてしまったら、後戻りはできないのよ。", "zh": "……真的没关系吗？\n一旦开始了，可就无法回头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1064_029umi", "source_sha256": "a0465e6323ef1bb72916e1a3f403c7c132d49ce6ed01175e2dcb6d49df3cd69d", "ja": "わかってる。でもこれでいいの。", "zh": "我知道。但这样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1065_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a4083a770a76b0e47e73fc887e85d39742e561c649979135c95e886803deed25", "ja": "……後悔するわよ。", "zh": "……你会后悔的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_04_1066_029umi", "source_sha256": "b159d2ba0bc70604491dfa8977023a46aa57077ecf58172df255c1951ee3c657", "ja": "……そうだといいね。", "zh": "……要是那样就好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
